data: {"id": "73acacb894104f81-thinking-parallel_evidence-2422", "run_id": "73acacb894104f81", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Prometheus Metrics (已预先执行)**：\n    - `kube_pod_status_phase` = 1 (Pending)；`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (reason=\"ContainerCreating\")；`kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0。\n    - Pod UID: `3f9c97a0-dee7-484f-90ee-dcce79c0b28b`；Node: `node2`；Container: `app`。\n    - ✅ 确认 Pod 处于 **Pending/ContainerCreating**，未进入 Running，无重启。\n\n2. **kubectl describe pod**：\n    - 关键错误信息：**`NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' not found in namespace 'aiops-case-05'`*", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788782881919, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "73acacb894104f81-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "73acacb894104f81", "seq": 2423, "ts_ms": 1788782890200, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 47.753, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/73acacb894104f81-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "b60ec23ab901ebd6d34a58e4fe9f7f78f60d4ddb3204c1c158061d5d288f06a8", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "46bd2ec5a8f470eefa982295be9039cb610a04fec50c4f99d433676ad107153d"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "73acacb894104f81-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "73acacb894104f81", "seq": 2424, "ts_ms": 1788782890201, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "73acacb894104f81-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "73acacb894104f81", "seq": 2425, "ts_ms": 1788782903888, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 13.687, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 2510, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx stuck in Pending/ContainerCreating |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `reason: FailedCreatePodSandBox, message: ... plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add): Multus: [aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx]: error loading k8s delegates k8s args: TryLoadPodDelegates: error in getting k8s network for pod: GetNetworkDelegates: failed getting the delegate: getKubernetesDelegate: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` (fact-2decccaf7b66) | 直接归因：kubelet 创建沙箱失败，原因是 Multus 无法找到指定的 `unavailable-network` CNI 委托定义。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `reason: NoNetworkFound, message: ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` (fact-0fd2f88e29b3) | 现象确认：Multus 持续报错提示该网络定义缺失，覆盖了事件发生的时间窗口。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container: app, reason: ContainerCreating` (fact-f04ce03b5030) | 状态锁定：Pod 无法通过沙箱创建阶段，容器持续处于等待状态。 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason, reason: ContainerCreating, value: 1` (fact-b461cb8f2e50) | 指标佐证：Prometheus 监控确认容器因 `ContainerCreating` 原因处于等待状态。 |\n\n**证据逻辑说明：**\nKubernetes 事件（事实 1 与事实 2）明确指出 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 是由于 Multus CNI 无法找到 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间下的 `unavailable-network` 网络定义所致。这一配置层面的缺失直接解释了容器状态（事实 3）和指标（事实 4）中 `ContainerCreating` 长期卡死的现象。日志与追踪维度因容器未启动而被标记为不适用，证据链完整。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' (未确认/基于事件推断) → Multus CNI 无法加载该网络定义 (已确认：event fact-0fd2f88e29b3/fact-2decccaf7b66) → Kubelet 沙箱创建失败 (已确认：event fact-2decccaf7b66) → Pod 卡死在 Pending/ContainerCreating (已确认：state fact-f04ce03b5030/metric fact-b461cb8f2e50)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：\nPod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 被配置为使用 Multus CNI 网络，但该配置引用了一个在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 资源（名为 `unavailable-network`）。\n\n**导致机制**：\n1.  Kubernetes 调度 Pod 后，kubelet 尝试创建 Pod 沙箱。\n2.  Multus CNI 插件根据 Pod 配置尝试加载 `unavailable-network` 定义（事实 1、2）。\n3.  由于该定义不存在，Multus 抛出错误并拒绝配置网络。\n4.  网络配置失败导致沙箱创建失败，Pod 无法进入运行阶段，从而卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（事实 3、4）。\n\n现有证据（特别是 K8s 事件中的明确报错文本）足以支撑该结论，证据充分。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx stuck in Pending/ContainerCreating |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `reason: FailedCreatePodSandBox, message: ... plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add): Multus: [aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx]: error loading k8s delegates k8s args: TryLoadPodDelegates: error in getting k8s network for pod: GetNetworkDelegates: failed getting the delegate: getKubernetesDelegate: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` (fact-2decccaf7b66) | 直接归因：kubelet 创建沙箱失败，原因是 Multus 无法找到指定的 `unavailable-network` CNI 委托定义。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `reason: NoNetworkFound, message: ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` (fact-0fd2f88e29b3) | 现象确认：Multus 持续报错提示该网络定义缺失，覆盖了事件发生的时间窗口。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container: app, reason: ContainerCreating` (fact-f04ce03b5030) | 状态锁定：Pod 无法通过沙箱创建阶段，容器持续处于等待状态。 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason, reason: ContainerCreating, value: 1` (fact-b461cb8f2e50) | 指标佐证：Prometheus 监控确认容器因 `ContainerCreating` 原因处于等待状态。 |\n\n**证据逻辑说明：**\nKubernetes 事件（事实 1 与事实 2）明确指出 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 是由于 Multus CNI 无法找到 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间下的 `unavailable-network` 网络定义所致。这一配置层面的缺失直接解释了容器状态（事实 3）和指标（事实 4）中 `ContainerCreating` 长期卡死的现象。日志与追踪维度因容器未启动而被标记为不适用，证据链完整。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' (未确认/基于事件推断) → Multus CNI 无法加载该网络定义 (已确认：event fact-0fd2f88e29b3/fact-2decccaf7b66) → Kubelet 沙箱创建失败 (已确认：event fact-2decccaf7b66) → Pod 卡死在 Pending/ContainerCreating (已确认：state fact-f04ce03b5030/metric fact-b461cb8f2e50)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：\nPod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 被配置为使用 Multus CNI 网络，但该配置引用了一个在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 资源（名为 `unavailable-network`）。\n\n**导致机制**：\n1.  Kubernetes 调度 Pod 后，kubelet 尝试创建 Pod 沙箱。\n2.  Multus CNI 插件根据 Pod 配置尝试加载 `unavailable-network` 定义（事实 1、2）。\n3.  由于该定义不存在，Multus 抛出错误并拒绝配置网络。\n4.  网络配置失败导致沙箱创建失败，Pod 无法进入运行阶段，从而卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（事实 3、4）。\n\n现有证据（特别是 K8s 事件中的明确报错文本）足以支撑该结论，证据充分。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

